@startuml
title BMS Preliminary Fault Tree - Undetected Overvoltage (SG-001)

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

rectangle "TOP EVENT:\nUnsafe battery operation due to\nundetected overvoltage" as TOP #FFEBEE

rectangle "Cell Voltage Measurement Failure\n(Primary & Secondary Acquisition)" as F1 #FFF8E6
rectangle "Overvoltage Diagnostic Failure\n(Threshold & Plausibility Logic)" as F2 #FFF8E6
rectangle "Charging Inhibition Failure\n(Power Limit & Contactor Open)" as F3 #FFF8E6
rectangle "Fault Reaction / Comm Failure\n(VCU / OBC Notification & Safe State)" as F4 #FFF8E6

' Preliminary contributor sub-branches
rectangle "Cell Monitoring IC\nADC Stuck / Drift" as F1_1 #F5F5F5
rectangle "Sense Wire Open /\nHigh Resistance" as F1_2 #F5F5F5

rectangle "Master MCU SW\nThreshold Check Hang" as F2_1 #F5F5F5
rectangle "AFE HW Comparator\nLatent Failure" as F2_2 #F5F5F5

rectangle "Contactor Driver\nFails to Open" as F3_1 #F5F5F5
rectangle "Main Contactor\nWelded Closed" as F3_2 #F5F5F5

rectangle "CAN Bus-Off / E2E\nMessage Loss" as F4_1 #F5F5F5
rectangle "OBC Ignores Zero\nCharge Limit" as F4_2 #F5F5F5

' Top-level relationships (preliminary contributor links)
TOP -- F1
TOP -- F2
TOP -- F3
TOP -- F4

F1 -- F1_1
F1 -- F1_2

F2 -- F2_1
F2 -- F2_2

F3 -- F3_1
F3 -- F3_2

F4 -- F4_1
F4 -- F4_2

note bottom of TOP
  Preliminary Fault Contributor Diagram (ISO 26262-9).
  Formal FTA shall replace generic links with explicit AND/OR gates
  and evaluate Common-Cause Failures (CCF) across redundant paths.
end note

@enduml
